{"title":"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the reciprocal of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/c/cccb103143393c0119f5ab61d6d53a852ce70fcf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/4/b/d4baf6d4b1cfa69b68b3204b5e2eba0c5755fe20.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"44\" height=\"15\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/7/4575ccee1bd4a5c81c929e66c27fb2023d73d806.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 1\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ -1\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ \\pm 1\\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"479\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We form the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/c/ebcc2d4005e3f3f87f0c15b2342566489ad6edec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x+1=\\frac{1}{x-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"37\" />.  \n</p><p>Getting rid of the fraction yields: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/1/0a1a6af27a295b8b95429515732e126447d82d31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2-1=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef48ac956824fcaea163a530a717e6df694aa006.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/c/8ac618729dba68a6897cb9af673cce620aa320b1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2=2$\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/4/ef48ac956824fcaea163a530a717e6df694aa006.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\implies$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"9\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/d/7bdb5331b0a94c47c19245a4c547e9666d4ad3f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=\\pm{\\sqrt{2}}=\\boxed{\\text{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"120\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p>~mathsolver101\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We could plug in every value and see if the statement is satisfied.\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/3/2d348bde3e15456e71734dc2c56fc7425c95927f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/d/e8daef0fd0f6dfe459e8d94c06a218983425ffc5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + 1 = 1\\]\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/9/ac9d8f02e52580749bc5594244132bd7d4352275.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x - 1 = -1\\]\" width=\"87\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Invalid.\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/c/d/6cdeb8949f1da39ae13580709269f4360fefca5f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + 1 = 2\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/3/b03698d3d682e52b8f94a9f36f5025d977286cbe.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x - 1 = 0\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Invalid.\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4c38a419ae56f13a202216dd45a1978bc91a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/5/3f50a29879ac40bbc686a262409c284e2c59fe36.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x + 1 = 0\\]\" width=\"74\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/5/cb5370284a808c6dc42a2165aa7506b8856a455a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x - 1 = -2\\]\" width=\"88\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Invalid.\n</p><p>When <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/4/8d4c38a419ae56f13a202216dd45a1978bc91a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/3/34310f2f36ed6d724838edb08788ee62acb33386.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />:\n</p><p>We have already tested both these cases above, and we know that neither satisfy the statement.\n</p><p>Therefore, none of the answer choices above is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/3/d1302e73ece29d10218238af739577904f6f00a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{E}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" />.\n</p><p>~ThePlenGuy\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME\" title=\"1963 AHSME\">1963 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1963 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1963\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 25\">25</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_26\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 26\">26</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_27\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 27\">27</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_28\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 28\">28</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_29\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 29\">29</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_30\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 30\">30</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_31\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 31\">31</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_32\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 32\">32</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_33\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 33\">33</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_34\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 34\">34</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_35\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 35\">35</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_36\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 36\">36</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_37\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 37\">37</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_38\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 38\">38</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_39\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 39\">39</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_AHSME_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"1963 AHSME Problems/Problem 40\">40</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AHSME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AHSME Problems and Solutions\"> All AHSME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></s